#=========================================================================================
# ICsprout55 LVS: combine electrically parallel MOS fingers
#
# A reference width is not evidence of a physical connection. Never join
# distinct diffusion nets to make an extracted device match the schematic.
# In particular, a hierarchical macro has no direct top-cell ACT polygons;
# using that empty geometry as a group key can combine unrelated devices.
#
# KLayout's MOS4 combiner requires the same gate, bulk, channel length and
# unordered source/drain net pair, then sums parallel widths. It does not
# repair floating diffusion islands or alter their electrical connectivity.
netlist.combine_devices
